		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Hairless, necrotic giant covered in pustules and boils.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 13, <strong>HP</strong> 52, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 flail +5 (2d6) or 1 thrown corpse (far) +5 (2d4 + corpse bomb), <strong>MV</strong> double near, <strong>S</strong> +4, <strong>D</strong> +3, <strong>C</strong> +3, <strong>I</strong> +1, <strong>W</strong> +2, <strong>Ch</strong> +2, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 11</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Corpse Bomb</strong>. All creatures in a near-sized cube around where corpse lands, CON 12+ or diseased.</p><p></p><p><strong>Disease</strong>. CON 12+ or 1d4 CON damage (can't heal while ill). Repeat check once per day; ends on success. Die at 0 CON.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
